  "description": "The page reads the notification state of the host when it imports the plane and sends no call to the sidecar while two tabs of a plugin with a background session wait for their image detach, while the shown tab mounts after its detach ended and while the hidden tab stays unmounted after its detach failed; the failure of the hidden tab is written once as an error record of the surface status of its card and tab in the log batch after the clock answers of the host; clearing the plane gives the keyboard to the workbench with surfaceFocus, and the counts of the events that the gate refused leave in two last log batches.",
